#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "SVID 2."
msgstr "SVID 2."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Because of historical variations in behavior across systems, this function "
"is not specified in any recent standard."
msgstr ""
"Du fait de variations historiques dans le comportement de cette fonction sur "
"les différents systèmes, cette fonction n'est spécifiée dans aucune norme "
"récente."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"4.2BSD had a B<gamma>()  that computed ln(|Gamma(|I<x>|)|), leaving the sign "
"of Gamma(|I<x>|)  in the external integer I<signgam>.  In 4.3BSD the name "
"was changed to B<lgamma>(3), and the man page promises"
msgstr ""
"BSD\\ 4.2 avait une fonction B<gamma>() qui calculait ln(|Gamma(|I<x>|)|), "
"laissant le signe de Gamma(|I<x>|)  dans l'entier externe I<signgam>. Dans "
"BSD\\ 4.3, le nom a été modifié en B<lgamma>(3), et la page de manuel "
"promettait\\ :"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"At some time in the future the name gamma will be rehabilitated and used for "
"the Gamma function"
msgstr ""
"Un jour où l'autre, le nom gamma sera réhabilité et utilisé pour la fonction "
"Gamma."

#.  The FreeBSD man page says about gamma() that it is like lgamma()
#.  except that is does not set signgam.
#.  Also, that 4.4BSD has a gamma() that computes the true gamma function.
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"This did indeed happen in 4.4BSD, where B<gamma>()  computes the Gamma "
"function (with no effect on I<signgam>).  However, this came too late, and "
"we now have B<tgamma>(3), the \"true gamma\" function."
msgstr ""
"Cela est vraiment arrivé dans BSD 4.4 où B<gamma>() calcule la fonction "
"Gamma (sans effet sur I<signgam>). Toutefois, cela est venu trop tard, et "
"maintenant nous avons B<tgamma>(3), la vraie fonction gamma (Ndt\\ : «\\ "
"true gamma\\ »)."

